-------------------------------------------------------------------------
Components required at build time -- none of them bundled here
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

This suite links, includes, or compiles source from the following. No copy of
any of them is contained in this repository:

    Msgcore                     Apache License, Version 2.0.
    TargetCore                  Copyright 2000-2026 Ivyware Pty Ltd,
                                Khrustal & Mann. The two libraries under test;
                                each carries its own LICENSE and NOTICE.

    Platform                    The p2pplatform shim (IOCP / io_uring, the
                                string ring, P2PWCHAR). Part of the MSCS
                                solution; it has no public remote.

    MsgcoreMFC                  *** COMPILED IN, AND NOT APACHE-LICENSED. ***
                                On Windows, unit_suite compiles two source
                                files from this sibling directly into the test
                                executable -- COleTime_Ext.cpp and
                                CTime_Ext.cpp -- for the DATE-normalisation
                                helpers, rather than building the whole MFC UI
                                toolkit to link them.

                                Both files carry Ivyware Pty Ltd's older
                                permission-grant notice ("Beta release only",
                                Copyright(c) Ivyware Pty Ltd 2014 and 2006
                                respectively, all rights reserved) and have NOT
                                been relicensed to Apache-2.0 as Msgcore and
                                TargetCore were. That notice requires that it
                                appear in all copies and in supporting
                                documentation; this entry is that
                                documentation, and the notices in those two
                                files must not be removed.

                                The Linux build does not compile them: it uses
                                linux-shim/COleTime_Ext.h instead, which is
                                this repository's own work.

Two files here are compiled by OTHER repositories rather than by this one, and
carry their Apache headers with them:

    crypto_kat.cpp              Built by TargetCore/CMakeLists.txt, which
                                reaches into this directory for it.
    TestFramework.cpp           Compiled by path into MscsUnitTestsExternal's
                                runner, so that one framework serves both.


